EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}I thought I should return this thing{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I borrowed from you a while ago!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Sorry I took so long,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Quería devolverte esto.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Te lo pedí hace la tira{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}y todavía lo tenía por aquí.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Je voulais{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} te rendre ce truc que je
t'ai emprunté il y a un bon
moment...
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Désolé d'avoir mis si longtemps,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Mi avevi prestato questa cosa tanto
tempo fa!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ora te la rendo.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Scusa se
ci ho messo una vita,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bwa ha, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}nein! {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}Ausnahmsweise
ist mal nichts Schlimmes passiert.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ich hab da nur irgendwann mal was
Komisches von dir geliehen.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Ich brauch das jetzt nicht mehr.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du kannst es wiederhaben,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Bir süre önce senden ödünç aldığım şeyi
geri vereyim dedim{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bu kadar geciktiğim için kusura bakma,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Well, it's nothing important,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} but
I was in the store yesterday and
I found that thing you wanted{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}So I bought it for you!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Verás,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} no tiene mucha importancia,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
pero estabas muy pesada con no sé
qué cosa que estabas buscando{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.
Y como el otro día la vi en la tienda,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}pues te la compré.{{TAG:0007:0000:19000000}} ¡A ver si dejas
de dar la tabarra ya con eso!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Nein, {{TAG:0003:0006:}}es ist nichts. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Gar nichts.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Überhaupt nichts Wichtiges.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bloß das Ding hier.
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Ich hab's im Laden gefunden und
dachte, du magst es vielleicht.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Also hier,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} nimm mit!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Mira, es que ayer estaba dando
un paseo y me tropecé con esto.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Creo que es tuyo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿no?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bwa ha, nein! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ausnahmsweise
ist mal nichts Schlimmes passiert.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ich hab nur das hier gestern draußen
irgendwo gefunden.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Dachte erst, es 
wäre Müll.
Aber ich glaube, es gehört dir.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Richtig?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}I don't necessarily hate sweets,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0006:}}but
sweets sold in stores are just TOO
sweet, you know?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}I just need something with a more
savory taste{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}You're good at baking stuff,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
aren't you?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Could you make something for me
that isn't too sweet,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Verás, quería pedirte algo...{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Yo no soy muy de dulces, o por
lo menos de dulces industriales.
Se me hacen{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} demasiado dulces.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Necesito postres con un poco más
de sustancia,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} no sé si me explico{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}A ti se te da bien la repostería,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
¿verdad?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¿No podrías hornearme algo
que no sea demasiado dulce,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}J'aime bien le sucré, mais les choses
qui se vendent dans les magasins
sont... trop sucrées, tu vois ?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Il me faut un goût un peu plus
corsé{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tu es plutôt douée pour la cuisine,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
non ?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Tu pourrais me préparer quelque
chose de pas trop sucré,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}} ?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}Non è che odio tutti dolci...
È solo che quelli che si comprano
nei negozi sono troppo dolci!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Preferisco cose più{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}. salate,
sostanziose, succose!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Tu sei brava a fare i dolci, vero?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Non è che puoi prepararmi qualcosa
che non sia troppo dolce,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0008:}}Ich war im Laden. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich wollte mir
ausnahmsweise mal was Süßes
kaufen.
{{TAG:0003:0007:}}Aber alles Süße, was man im Laden
kriegt, ist völlig überzuckert!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Das
Zeug klebt so an den Zähnen!
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Deshalb musst du mir jetzt helfen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Du... {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Du kannst backen!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und du WIRST backen!
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Bwa ha ha{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ha ha!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Tatlılardan nefret ettiğim söylenemez,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}ama mağazada satılanlar gereğinden FAZLA
tatlı, biliyor musun?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Daha tuzlu, daha dengeli bir şey lazım
bana{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sen hamur işi yapmada iyisin,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
değil mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bana çok tatlı olmayan bir şey
yapabilir misin,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Los del pueblo piensan que soy un
tío muy seco y tal,{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}} ¿{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Creo que es por mi forma de hablar.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Tú que eres tan dulce,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¿no podrías enseñarme
a hablar más suave{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} o algo?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Venga, maestra!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Que no tenemos
todo el día, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Hai visto che tutti quanti in città
hanno paura di me,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Credo sia per il modo in cui parlo,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
quindi sto provando a parlare
un po' più... per bene. Capito, no?
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Di tutti i miei vicini, tu sei quella
che parla nel modo migliore,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Insomma,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} professoressa {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Mi insegni a parlare tutto per benino
come te?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}
